<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">KABAKUK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Kabakuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kabakuk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kab</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">KABAKUK</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok pa lanebi Kabakuk okati ikine ka mwaka miya abicel ki pyere aryo wiye abic nio kwede wa i miya abicel ki abicel ikare ma okato angec mapeya onongo kinywalo Yecu Kricito. Man obedo ikare me loc pa Manace rwot me Juda, wod pa Kejekia. Ikare meno jo Babilon onongo gin cogi oteka me wi lobo. Lanebi Kabakuk iye onongo pe yom pi tim aranyi pa jo Babilon ma onongo gin ger woko ata lataya. Man oweko lanebi Kabakuk openyo Rwot Lubanga ni, “Pingo in iling woko litik ma kun ineno kitye katyeko jo ma gin dok kitgi atir makato kit rok magi ma gin lutim aranyini?” 1:13. Rwot ogamo dog Lanebi ni, en ebitimo gin ma cwinye mito, ikarene kikome kun nongo jo ma kitgi atir bikwo pien gin lugen bot Lubanga. 2:4.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man nyutu kamaleng ni kadi bed Lubanga leng ento en pud tiyo ki jo maracu me cobo mitine iwi lobo man, kun keto can ikom lwake.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pol lok ma i buk man opongo ki lok me nebi pi bale pa piny ma bibino ikom jo maracu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man ogiko ki lega me wer me pwoyo ber pa Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man nen okani manok pien lanebi aye tye kajuku Lubanga ma ka Lubanga me juku lwake.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Nguru pa lanebi Kabakuk ikom Lubanga ki lagam pa Rwot <char style="ior"><ref loc="HAB 1:1-2:4">1:1—2:4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Can ikom jo ma kitgi pe atir <char style="ior"><ref loc="HAB 2:5-20">2:5-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lega pa Kabakuk <char style="ior"><ref loc="HAB 3:1-19">3:1-19</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAB 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 1:1" />Man lok pa Lubanga ma pire tek ma Lubanga onyutu bot lanebi Kabakuk.<verse eid="HAB 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kabakuk obako doge pi tim ma pe atir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 1:2" />Ai Rwot, imito ni akok boti pi kare marom mene pi kony, yaka wek dong ilarwa? <verse eid="HAB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 1:3" />Pingo imiyo aneno tim maracu ma wanga neno tim aranyi? Topiny ki bwami guruma woko dyere, lweny ki daa tye i kabedo ducu. <verse eid="HAB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 1:4" />Cik dong odoko goro, ngolo kop ma atir bene dong peke. Jo maracu giloyo pido ikom jo ma kitgi atir, omiyo ngolo kop atir dong obale woko.<verse eid="HAB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lagam pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:41">Tic 13:41</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Rwot Lubanga owaco ni, “Wungi ikin lurok ma orumuwu, wek kong wunen; ci wubibedo ki twon ur matek tutwal ka kitito ki wun. Atye katiyo tic mo ikarewuni ma pe wubiye ka kitito botwu. <verse eid="HAB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:2">2 Luk 24:2</ref></char></note> Nen atye kakelo jo Kaldaya, en rok mager, matye kadore me bino, kun gingolo dye lobo arii, pi mako kabedo pa jo mukene ma pe meggi. <verse eid="HAB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 1:7" />Gin jo makelo lworo ki myelkom madwong; gitiyo ki awakagi ci pe giparo pi lubu cik pa rok mukene.<verse eid="HAB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 1:8" />Aguraguragi dwir makato kwac, giger makato orudi ma owor. Luring ki aguraguragi gia ki kamabor; aguraguragi gingweco ma gingwinyo ngom. Eyo, gituk oyotoyot macalo ocur ma lyane piny kaceyo came.<verse eid="HAB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 1:9" />Monygi ducu gucore magwa; dano acel acel bedo ki lworo marac ka ginyiko cok. Gimako opii ma welgi pe kwane calo nyig kweyo. <verse eid="HAB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 1:10" />Gingalo luker ducu, ginyero luloc kun gicayogi. Cel gogo mo ma gengogi peke, gin gitoro ngom ikomgi ci gimako woko oyot. <verse eid="HAB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 1:11" />Ci gikato woko oyot calo yamo ma kodo; ma gicito mere matwal; guloko tek komgi odoko lubangagi.”<verse eid="HAB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kabakuk dok obako doge bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 1:12" />Rwot, in ma ibedo tye nia i acaki piny! In Lubangana, in ngat maleng ma pe to. Ai Rwot, in yam iyero jo Babilon dok imiyogi tek; dok in Got, dong ityeko cikogi me pwodowa. <verse eid="HAB 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 1:13" />Ento in wangi leng, pe imito neno gin marac, cwinyi dag neno jo ma gitimo dano marac. Ci gin ango kono ma omiyo iketo cwinyi kakanyo jo ma gungayo wangi wokoni, kun iling alinga ka jo maracu gineko jo ma kitgi atir makatogi?<verse eid="HAB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 1:14" />In imiyo kimako dano kadok kinekogi woko bene macalo rec me nam, onyo macalo gin ma gilak alaka ma rwotgi peke me telo wigi. <verse eid="HAB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 1:15" />Jo Babilon yutu dano woko ducu ki goli, macalo giywayo rec. Gin giywayogi woko ki obwo, ci gicokogi i ogwagi; yaka gicako myel ki yomcwiny pi makogi. <verse eid="HAB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 1:16" />Pimeno ka gin gumakowa, ci gityero gitum me woro jami lwenygi ma gutiyo kwede me makowa, ci dok giwango odok eceta me woro ogwagi. Gin giwaco ni jami lwenygi omiyogi lwak lonyo mapol, dok gitye ki cam me wel madwong.<verse eid="HAB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 1:17" />In mono ibiye ni gin jonu gumede ameda ki lweny ki pala lucwangi ce ikom rok mapol matwal? In mono ibiye ni gin jonu gutyek dano woko ce ki kit nek marac labongo kica?<verse eid="HAB 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ogamo lok pa Kabakuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 2:1" />An abicung iwi lubelena kun akuru lagam pa Rwot, abiito malo iwi lubele, ci abikuru wek awiny gin ma Rwot bitito bota, ki gin ma en bidok iye bota ma kemo nguruna.<verse eid="HAB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 2:2" />Ci Rwot omiya lagam man ni, “Coo gin ma ineno; coo maber ikom got ma apada matwero kwane maber, wek ngat ma kwano oniang iye oyotoyot. <verse eid="HAB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:37">Ibru 10:37</ref></char></note>Ginanyuta man tye kuru kare ma Rwot ociko; en loko pi agiki kun goba mo peke iye, kare me cobone dong cok, tye kawot oyotoyot mada. Kadi bed nen ni bino motmot, bed ikur; kare man bibino ada, pe dok bigale. <verse eid="HAB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">Rom 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:11">Gal 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:38">Ibru 10:38</ref></char></note>Nen, man aye kwena ma mako jo man: Gin jo ma cwinygi pe atir pe bikwo, ento ngat ma kite atir bibedo kwo pi niyene ikom Lubanga.”<verse eid="HAB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Can bipoto ikom jo ma kitgi pe atir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 2:5" />Jo ma giketo cwinygi ikom lonyogi gibwole ken gi. Jo ma gimaro lonyo gupong ki awaka dok cwinygi bene pe bedo ma opye mot. Gin luworo calo bur lyel; girom ki to ma pe yeng. Ma oweko gin gimito loyo rok ducu pirgi ken gi, wek gipinygi ducu gubed meggi. <verse eid="HAB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 2:6" />Ento kare dong onyiko cok ma jo ma kiloyogini gibiloko lok agec ikom jo Babilon, ma gingalogi ki lok makec kun giwaco ni, “Itye ki can, in ngat ma icoko gin ma pe meri ci iduru kacel lipim. Ibibedo ki jami ayaka pi kare marom mene? Pi kare marom mene ma ibidiyo lubanyani me culu limi?”<verse eid="HAB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 2:7" />Jo ma yam itiyo ki gero ikomgini gibia labongo ngeci ci gin bene gibidiyo in me culu banyani ki lwak magoba. Lumeroki gibibino ci gibimiyo komi myel matek atika. Ci in ibidoko ginayaka botgi. <verse eid="HAB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 2:8" />Pien yam iyako rok mapol atika, ento kombedi rok ma gubwote ducu gibiyako in, pi tim aranyini me neko dano ki tim me bwamini i lobo ma itimo ikom taun madito ki jo ducu ma gibedo i igi.<verse eid="HAB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 2:9" />Ibineno can, in ma inongo magoba ki bwami pi konyo ki jo ma meri, wek iger ki odi malo iwi cere, kama gin marac pe twero o iye boti! <verse eid="HAB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 2:10" />Ento in ikelo lewic ikom jo ma i odi, pien ineko rok mapol; omiyo ilanyo kwoni nono. <verse eid="HAB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 2:11" />Kadi wa godi ma kigero ki kom ot gibikok matek, ci bao me rii ot ducu gibigamo kokogi.<verse eid="HAB 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 2:12" />Itye ki can, in ma igero taun madit kun ibedo ka oyo remo pa dano, ma iketo tegutine ki tim me bal! <verse eid="HAB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 2:13" />Rok ducu mayam iloyogi gin guolo komgi nono katiyo tic ma konye peke, dok gedo ducu ma gugero mac biwango woko. Rwot me mony aye otiyo man. <verse eid="HAB 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:9">Ica 11:9</ref></char></note>Ento lobo bipong ki ngec me deyo pa Rwot macalo pii ma pong i nam<verse eid="HAB 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 2:15" />Itye ki can in ma itoyo kinigani ikom luwoti, kun idiyogi ki tek wek gumato lwak kongo mapol ci gumer woko ka dong giwoto ma gicato, in imiyo ginen calo lumero, wek inen munerogi!<verse eid="HAB 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 2:16" />Ibibedo ki lewic madwong ma ka bedo ki deyo. In kikomi aye myero imati, ka wek ipange ki wot! Rwot aye bimiyo imato ki kikopo me pwodi, ci deyoni biloke doko lewic. <verse eid="HAB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 2:17" />Bwami ma ityeko timone ikom bunga me Lebanon bene kibitimone ikomi ci biumi woko lipuk; dok nek ma ineko ki lee tim ma bedo iye, in bene lee tim bimiyi lworo madwong. Man bitime ikomi pi bedo laneko ki latim bwami ikom lobo, ki ikom taun madito ki jo ducu ma gibedo i igi.<verse eid="HAB 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 2:18" />Cal jok apaya tye ki kony ango? En gin ma dano opayo, cal nyonyo mamwa, ma pwonyo mere goba keken. Konyo ango ka lapa cal jok keto gene ikom gin ma en otiyo? En cal lubanga matye ki dog ento pe twero loko gin mo. <verse eid="HAB 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 2:19" />Itye ki can, in ma iwaco ki cal yat ma ipayo ni, “Coo woko!” Ki dok bot got ma pe lokoni, “A malo!” Cal meno twero nyutu kit gin ango bot ngat mo? Nen, kideyo kome ki jabu ki ryal, ento aluu me yweyo pe tye i iye wa ki acel.<verse eid="HAB 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAB 2:20" />Ento Rwot tye i Ot mere maleng; wek jo ducu ma i lobo guling mot inyime.<verse eid="HAB 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HAB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Kabakuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 3:1" />Man aye lega pa lanebi Kabakuk:<verse eid="HAB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 3:2" />Ai Rwot. Atyeko winyo pi gin ma itiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">tici ma itiyo omiya twon lworo ki myelkom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">Dok itii aye ikarewa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">tic madito mayam ibedo katiyogi ikare ma okato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">wek tici ongene ikarewa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">Bed lakica kadi bed kiniga maki.<verse eid="HAB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 3:3" />Lubanga dok tye kabino ki i Teman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:3">Ngat Maleng tye ka a ki iwi got Paran.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:3">Derone oryeny umu polo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:3">lobo ducu opong kipak me deyone.<verse eid="HAB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 3:4" />En bino maryeny calo ceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:4">dero wil a ki i cinge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:4">en kano twerone kunu.<verse eid="HAB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 3:5" />En cwalo two gemo inyime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:5">ka dok ociko to me lubu kore.<verse eid="HAB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 3:6" />Ikare ma ocung, lobo oyenge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">ka oneno piny, rok ducu komgi omyel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">Godi ma girii nakanaka gumuk woko liweng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">ki cere ma bedo matwal gilwiny gidok gidonyo piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">ki cere yoo ma en yam woto iye ikare macon odoko apyel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">En aye ma bedo kwo nakanaka!<verse eid="HAB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 3:7" />Aneno kema pa jo Kucan tye ki can,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:7">ki jo Midian komgi gumyel.<verse eid="HAB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 3:8" />Rwot, akemo mono onongo omaki ikom kulu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">Kinigani onongo tye ikom kulu bo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">Gwok nyo ibedo ki akemo ikom nam ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">ikare ma iringo ki aguragurani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">ki iwi gadigadini ma ikelo loc bot joni?<verse eid="HAB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 3:9" />Dong ityeko yube me telo atumi me celo piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:9">kidok juruni opong ki atero madwong.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:9">Imiyo lutkoti omeny obaro i lobo.<verse eid="HAB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 3:10" />Ka godi guneni, ci guyenge matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:10">pii ocako mol ki lalele marac tutwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:10">pii matut ma ite lobo omor matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:10">wa biamwonyine ducu oile malo adada.<verse eid="HAB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 3:11" />Pi dero me ateroni ma dong ibayogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:11">ki wil pa tongi maryeny tutwali</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:11">Ceng ki dwe gucung mot i kabedogi.<verse eid="HAB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 3:12" />Idore i dye lobo ki akemo magwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:12">ki kiniga magwa inyono rok woko piny.<verse eid="HAB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 3:13" />Icito ka lweny pi laro wan joni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:13">ki pi laro rwoti ma dong i wiro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:13">Inginyo wi latela pa jo maracu woko kun iweke odong munero cake ki i eme wa i ngute, ci ityeko bene jo ma lube ducu liweng.<verse eid="HAB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 3:14" />Itiyo ki aterone me ocobo wi latela pa lulwenye pa merok wa woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:14">ma onongo gubino macalo yamo lapiru ma gimito ketowa woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:14">gupong ki yomcwiny madwong kun gimito neko lucan woko i mung.<verse eid="HAB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 3:15" />Inyono nam ki aguragurani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:15">kun ingolo ki i dye pii matek ma twage gunye agunya.<verse eid="HAB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 3:16" />Ka awinyo man, ci koma myel marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">del doga bene omyel pi lworo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">Cogona ducu ongo odoko calo pii keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">anongo tyena myel amyela ka awoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">Atye kakuru nino me can mot</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">en nino ma bibino ikom jo ma gilwenyo ikomwani.<verse eid="HAB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 3:17" />Kadi bed yat oduru pe gituru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">ki olok bene pe ginyak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">kadi bed yat jeituni bene dong pe twero ceko gin mo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">ki poti ducu pe dong ceko cam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">kadi bed romi ma i dwol kityekogi woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">ki dyangi bene dong peke i dwol,<verse eid="HAB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 3:18" />pud abibedo ki wake pi Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:18">abinyate ki yomcwiny madwong pi Lubanga Lalara.<verse eid="HAB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:34">2 Cam 22:34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:33">Jab 18:33</ref></char>
    </note>Lubanga, ma en Rwot, aye tek mera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:19">en miyo tyena bedo yot calo tyen til,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:19">en bigwoka ka awoto iwi ceregu.<verse eid="HAB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 3" />
</usx>